<h1>Darren Bailey</h1>
<p>Governor &amp; Lieutenant Governor, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.baileyforillinois.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (baileyforillinois.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Running a rematch of the 2022 race with running mate Aaron Del Mar after winning the March primary with about 54 percent. His campaign emphasizes affordability and property tax relief, support for working families and American jobs, protecting Second Amendment rights, and opposition to abortion.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Farmer and businessman from Clay County; served in the Illinois House and Senate and was the 2022 Republican nominee for governor.</p>
